  "historical_qualification": "Existing GoD Portion of Infused Dark Matter488 consumes five Grains of Infused Dark Matter62492 but returns five Portions62500. Maintained primary explicitly specifies yield1; propose only output entry3803 successcount5 to1. Native62500 is stackable with maxcharges0, so this is a physical output quantity, not charged-device encoding. Existing definition/trivial16/ingredients/salvage/kits/minimum/learning/availability and other Portion producers preserved. Current-source reconstruction, not immutable2013/native combine or quest/progression proof. Raw Dark Matter and Raw Infused Dark Matter progressive1to3 refinements417/448 are separate and unchanged.",
